id: addon-site
section: Personas and add-ons
item: The add-on site on the TouchPad: the nav takes a tap (Personas opens), the search field takes the keyboard, a Wear asks first and names the site (Cancel leaves the Default look)
shells: enyo mochi mojo
page: https://addons.riverstonerelay.org/
kit: cavekit-addons-site.md R7
needs: internet
wait rect 'sel:form.search input' 60
calibrate 'sel:form.search input'
tap 'sel:form.search input'
expect keyboard up 8
chrome kb-hide
expect keyboard down 8
tap 'sel:a[href="/personas/"]'
wait url /personas/ 40
wait rect 'sel:a.button[data-browsertheme]' 20
tap 'sel:a.button[data-browsertheme]'
expect dialog present 8
chrome dialog-cancel
expect dialog answered 8
wait pref b lightweightThemes.isThemeSelected false 6
